sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant Comp as React Page/Component
    participant AuthCtx as AuthProvider (Context)
    participant Client as Axios Instance (api-client)
    participant Interceptor as Axios Response Interceptor
    participant Backend as NestJS API (/auth/*)
    participant Storage as Cookie/LocalStorage

    Note over User,Backend: 1. Đăng nhập (Login Flow)
    User->>Comp: Nhập username, password -> Submit
    Comp->>AuthCtx: login({ username, password })
    AuthCtx->>Client: POST /auth/login
    Client->>Backend: POST /auth/login
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (AuthRes: accessToken, refreshToken, user)
    Client-->>AuthCtx: AuthRes
    AuthCtx->>Storage: Lưu accessToken, refreshToken, user
    AuthCtx->>AuthCtx: setState({ user, isAuthenticated: true })
    AuthCtx-->>Comp: Hoàn thành
    Comp->>User: Redirect tới Dashboard hoặc Return URL

    Note over User,Backend: 2. Đăng ký & Xác thực OTP (Register & Email Verification Flow)
    User->>Comp: Nhập username, email, password, displayName -> Submit
    Comp->>AuthCtx: register(data)
    AuthCtx->>Client: POST /auth/register
    Client->>Backend: POST /auth/register
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (RegisterPendingRes: message, email)
    Client-->>AuthCtx: RegisterPendingRes
    AuthCtx-->>Comp: Redirect sang /verify-email?email=...
    User->>Comp: Nhập mã OTP 6 số
    Comp->>AuthCtx: verifyEmail({ email, code })
    AuthCtx->>Client: POST /auth/verify-email
    Client->>Backend: POST /auth/verify-email
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (UserRes: userId, username, email, role, profile)
    Client-->>AuthCtx: UserRes
    AuthCtx-->>Comp: Thông báo thành công -> Chuyển sang /login

    Note over User,Backend: 3. Xử lý Token Expiry & Race-Condition Refresh Queue
    Comp->>Client: Request API A (kèm Bearer AccessToken đã hết hạn)
    Comp->>Client: Request API B (đồng thời gọi API B)
    Client->>Backend: Request A
    Backend-->>Interceptor: 401 Unauthorized
    Note over Interceptor: isRefreshing = false -> Bắt đầu Refresh
    Interceptor->>Interceptor: isRefreshing = true
    Client->>Backend: Request B
    Backend-->>Interceptor: 401 Unauthorized
    Note over Interceptor: isRefreshing = true -> Push Request B vào failedQueue
    Interceptor->>Backend: POST /auth/refresh-token ({ refreshToken })
    alt Refresh thành công
        Backend-->>Interceptor: 200 OK (AuthRes: accessToken mới, refreshToken mới)
        Interceptor->>Storage: Cập nhật accessToken, refreshToken mới
        Interceptor->>AuthCtx: Cập nhật token trong state
        Interceptor->>Backend: Retry Request A với accessToken mới
        Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (Dữ liệu Request A)
        Interceptor->>Backend: Xả failedQueue -> Retry Request B với accessToken mới
        Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (Dữ liệu Request B)
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: isRefreshing = false, failedQueue = []
    else Refresh thất bại (Refresh Token hết hạn / không hợp lệ)
        Backend-->>Interceptor: 401 Unauthorized
        Interceptor->>Storage: Xóa accessToken, refreshToken, user
        Interceptor->>AuthCtx: logout()
        Interceptor->>Interceptor: Reject tất cả request trong failedQueue
        Interceptor->>User: Redirect về /login
    end
